# Hardhat build artifacts (regenerated by npx hardhat compile)
contracts/artifacts/
contracts/cache/

# Defensive: a root-level cache/ from any build tool invoked at the repo root.
# The runtime boundary guard's tree scope counts UNTRACKED files as changed paths
# (scripts/wp2/generate-pvt9-base-config.mjs, changedPathsFromBaseline), so a
# root cache/ would trip check:wp2 as an out-of-allowlist path. Note: not
# currently reachable via forge -- there is no root foundry.toml, and a root
# `forge build` reports "Nothing to compile" without creating cache/. This is
# cheap insurance for a real guard mechanism, not a fix for an observed break.
/cache/

# Swift Package Manager build artifacts (provian-se-sign)
provian-se-sign/.build/

# Dev screenshots
screenshots/

# Claude Code local state (audit reports under .claude/audit/ are tracked)
# Ignore everything in .claude EXCEPT the committed run-harness bits:
# the project settings.json and the compaction-recovery hook (must be repo-level).
.claude/*
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/print-active-run.sh

# Codex / other-tool local files (AGENTS.md is a local, untracked mirror of CLAUDE.md)
.codex/
AGENTS.md

# Firebase emulator debug logs
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log
firestore-rules-test/firebase-debug.log

# Firebase project alias (real project id — keep local, do not commit)
.firebaserc
*.egg-info/

# activation P2 deploy receipts — operator run artifacts (public addresses + tx hashes,
# never key material). Kept out of the tree so a partial run cannot trip
# check:wp2's tree-scope guard; the canonical record is docs/activation_PRE_ARM_REPORT.md §3.
wp12-deploy-receipt.*.json
scratchpad/

# Local EAS build artifacts. `eas build --local` drops a ~180 MB APK/AAB
# at the repo root as build-<epoch>.apk. There was NO ignore rule for these until
# 2026-07-29, and this session ran `git add -A` on every commit — an APK present
# in the tree at any of those moments would have been committed. Ignored, not
# deleted: the artifact is the launch deliverable.
build-*.apk
build-*.aab
*.apk
*.aab

# Deploy-time reconciliation evidence: regenerated by every gated deploy, and the
# AUTHORITATIVE copy is published to Firestore (pvt9_reconciliation_reports_v1).
# Local copies are working files the deploy script globs for; they should not
# accumulate in git one-per-deploy.
provian-backend/wp11-cutover-dry-run.*.json

# Vision/onboarding art regen staging + backups (scripts/regen-vision-images.mjs)
assets/images/regen-*/
assets/images/*.bak-*

# Local standing instructions and internal-repo working setup
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
CODEX_STARTUP.md
.claude/

# Dependencies may be local symlinks as well as directories.
**/node_modules

# Offline geolocation database is bundled at relay image build time.
provian-backend/data/jurisdiction/*.mmdb
provian-backend/data/jurisdiction/geo-metadata.json
